# HOT-RELOAD-VFX (owner: «hot reload тогда можно сразу добавить?»): Live Coding patches DesertVFX's
# SpawnState::Step (VFXEmitterSpawn.cpp:376-413, called from VFXWorld.cpp:170 in another unity batch) to give
# no births. The Starter Campfire stops spawning, its live particles die within their lifetime (<= 1.2 s), the
# scene is not reopened; the reverted patch brings the flames back.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/Starter.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Open "VFX/Campfire.dfx"
Когда 120 frames render
Тогда 0_before the .dfx preview and the level viewport behind it both show the Campfire flames
Когда-файл apply Scenarios/VFX/HOT-RELOAD-VFX.patch
Когда run "Live Coding" "Patch changed sources"
Когда wait-idle
Когда state
Когда 400 frames render
Тогда 1_after no flames in the preview and none at the level Campfire; the logs and the rest of the scene are as in 0_before; the Campfire.dfx tab is still open (no reload, no reopen); editor.log has one "[LiveCoding] patched" line naming VFXEmitterSpawn.cpp and no scene open after it
Когда-файл revert Scenarios/VFX/HOT-RELOAD-VFX.patch
Когда run "Live Coding" "Patch changed sources"
Когда wait-idle
Когда 120 frames render
Тогда 2_back the flames burn again in the preview and at the level Campfire, as in 0_before
